directions, summing the probability mass function would need a range that depends on
the parameters. Instead, \code{pskellam} uses the identity
\deqn{P(X \le q;\, \mu_1, \mu_2) = \int_{\mu_1}^\infty P(X = q;\, t, \mu_2)\, dt,}
